---------------\nFollow us:\n\n🅾 INSTAGRAM:   / fplblackbox  \n\n💻 DISCORD:   / discord  \n\n🐦X: https://www.x.com/fplblackbox\n-----------------------------------------------\n#FPLBlackBox #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #premierleague #GW38 Fantasy Football Scout, Fantasy Football Tips, Fantasy Football Gameweek 38 GW 38\n-----------------------------------------------\nContact us: \n\n📧 Az@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Andy@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Luke@fplblackbox.com\n\nLobby 0:00\nStart 0:05\nSeason Review - A Season of Bad Luck? 2:40\nSeason Review - By Gameweek 7:25\nBlackBox Lessons 42:55\nPlay World Cup GoalScorer Challenge with FPL BlackBox! 48:46","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":478,"length":30,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwiC8pmX9quWAxUyy9IEHRaYK2JI9bO5guauw57rAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVppQ1lhUEtRYkZxVUhIVVluMWZMS3xBR3JiS2FsZGlSdjB5ZC1lQkVmWjJWd1ZhMVk0MDFaaFVKVUR6R3Nxd1RybmFBcHFuRWFZd0hadjR0TkVvVi1fcjFVM21BWkhzRVBYZVBsTUhTNERzTDBlWkVPYnRWeDFGWkNN\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=6z0NdmBOWfU","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUVppQ1lhUEtRYkZxVUhIVVluMWZMS3xBR3JiS2FsZGlSdjB5ZC1lQkVmWjJWd1ZhMVk0MDFaaFVKVUR6R3Nxd1RybmFBcHFuRWFZd0hadjR0TkVvVi1fcjFVM21BWkhzRVBYZVBsTUhTNERzTDBlWkVPYnRWeDFGWkNN\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=6z0NdmBOWfU","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":762,"length":22,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwiC8pmX9quWAxUyy9IEHRaYK2JI9bO5guauw57rAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUmx0MV94MElxMklqY1Nnekx3UTU1WHxBR3JiS2FtU1UyWFBEMG1ZZFplWGMzSzg5UTF4WktPMmJsYU9oUzRicWNuVVlZSVF3S2tQb1JTRG0xdmhrR